              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza indlu eNgcwelengcwele, ubude bayo babulingana nobubanzi bendlu, buyizingalo ezingamashumi amabili, nobubanzi bayo buyizingalo ezingamashumi amabili; wayinameka ngegolide elihle lamatalenta angamakhulu ayisithupha.",
          "type": "text",
