          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaphiko amakherubi ayeyizingalo ezingamashumi amabili ubude; elinye iphiko lekherubi laliyizingalo eziyisihlanu, laya odongeni lwendlu; nelinye iphiko laliyizingalo eziyisihlanu ngokufanayo, kuze kufike ephikweni lelinye ikherubi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.11",
