          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iphiko lelinye ikherubi laliyizingalo eziyisihlanu, lakhuphukela odongeni lwendlu; nelinye iphiko laliyizingalo eziyisihlanu, lafinyelela ephikweni lelinye ikherubi.",
